        "id": "step_pp_oven-roasted-bbq-chicken_4",
        "stepNumber": 4,
        "instruction": "Top a baking tray with aluminum foil and geese it with 1 tablespoon of cooking oil or spray with a cooking oil spray. Arrange the chicken on top of the greased foil. Bake in the oven for 18 minutes.",
